    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s 7:00 AM, the alarm rings. Some mornings feel heavier than others...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From puzzle maestro Bart Bonte comes a point-and-click adventure filled with quirky challenges, surreal surprises and moody tunes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Undo the knots in your mind, one click at a time...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Leaving Home is a completely handcrafted point-and-click adventure that takes you through eight interconnected rooms, each with its own soundtrack, full of original puzzles that you must solve to make your way out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
